== Description ==

'''Scrap Iron''' is a refined metal ingot in ''[[Human Host]]'', sourced from the world (loot, salvage, or base crafting). It appears as an ingredient in 47 downstream recipes at 4 different workbenches, including [[Scrap Metal]], [[Iron Rock Concrete]], [[Scrap Greaves]], [[Firearm Kit]], [[M3]], [[Forged Iron]], among others. See the ''Used in'' table for the full consumer list.

